Package: rectangler
Type: Package
Title: Create Rectangle-Based Comparison Plots
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Helina", "Riisalu", email = "helinariisalu@hotmail.com", role = c("aut","cre"))
Maintainer: Helina Riisalu <helinariisalu@hotmail.com>
Description: Create rectangle-based comparison plots with proportional areas,
    labels, annotations, shapes, and styling layers. The package provides a
    small grammar for building rectangular visualisations step by step.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    magrittr,
    dplyr
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
